title: 'Symphony Phase 1: Cross-Machine Networking'
summary: Implemented WebSocket relay for cross-machine Symphony messaging. Hub-and-spoke topology with pairing code + HMAC-SHA256 authentication. Three new files (symphony-relay.ts, symphony-peers.ts, peers.ts CLI), seven modified code files, docs/university/CHANGELOG updates. Version bump to 3.46.0.
